# Generated by walkthrough/docx: the sliced screenshots, the parsed steps and the .docx itself.
# All three are reproducible from GUIDE.md and walkthrough/screenshots, which are already committed -
# so versioning them stores 10 MB of images twice and puts a build artifact through code review.
walkthrough/docx/build/
walkthrough/*.docx
